text.paragraph:
Clindamycin phosphate and benzoyl peroxide gel is contraindicated in those individuals who have shown hypersensitivity to clindamycin, benzoyl peroxide, any components of the formulation, or lincomycin. Anaphylaxis, as well as allergic reactions leading to hospitalization, has been reported in postmarketing use with clindamycin phosphate and benzoyl peroxide gel [see 

                              Postmarketing Experience (6.2)

                           ].

Clindamycin: Clindamycin is a lincosamide antibacterial [see 

   Microbiology (12.4)

].
